        "created_at": "2024-10-05T04:58:19.665Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Does Intangibility allow you to ignore attacks? The power doesn’t specifically say so; just “You can pass through solid objects.” If that means it works against physical attacks as well, what about energy attacks? Psychic attacks?</p>\n<p>How do you play it? If you’re immune to (some kinds of) attack while intangible, I’d assume at the very least you’re also unable to affect solid objects or launch attacks as long as it’s on; right? Does turning it on/off count as an action?</p>\n<p>Thanks in advance for your responses.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2024-10-05T04:58:19.665Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
